slug: taping-and-kinesiology-tape-evidence
title: Taping and Kinesiology Tape — What It Does and Does Not Do
area: Treatments & Evidence
level: Foundation
best: Second year onwards
minutes: 13
hook: Colourful tape became famous at the Olympics, and now it is on every athlete and many patients. Does it lift the skin, "decompress" tissue and speed healing? Or does it just feel nice and look cool? Rigid tape and elastic tape are very different things, and the evidence is different for each. || Rangeen tape Olympics mein mashhoor hui, aur ab har athlete aur bohat se mareezon par hai. Kya yeh jild ko uthati, tissue ko "dabao se azaad" karti aur sehatyabi tez karti hai? Ya sirf achhi lagti aur khoobsurat dikhti hai? Rigid tape aur elastic tape bohat mukhtalif cheezein hain, aur har ek ka saboot mukhtalif hai.
goal: By the end, you'll tell rigid (athletic) tape from elastic (kinesiology) tape, summarise what trials show for pain and function, name the proposed mechanisms and how well they hold up, use tape safely, and explain to patients honestly what to expect. || End tak aap rigid (athletic) tape ko elastic (kinesiology) tape se alag karenge, dard aur function par trials ka khulasa karenge, mumkina tareeqa-e-kaar aur woh kitne qaim rehte hain bayan karenge, tape mehfooz tareeqe se lagayenge, aur mareezon ko imaandari se batayenge kya umeed rakhein.
say: **Rigid tape** is non-stretch and is used to **restrict movement** and support a joint, for example after an ankle sprain. **Elastic tape** (often called kinesiology tape) stretches with the skin and is claimed to relieve pain, improve muscle function, reduce swelling and correct posture or movement. Research on elastic tape generally finds **small or no benefit beyond sham tape** (tape put on without proper tension or direction). The most believable effect is **sensory**: touch on the skin, a reminder to move differently, comfort and confidence. || **Rigid tape** na khinchne wali hoti hai aur **harkat roknay** aur joint ko sahara dene ke liye istemal hoti hai, masalan takhne ki moch ke baad. **Elastic tape** (aksar kinesiology tape kehlati hai) jild ke saath khinchti hai aur dard kam karne, muscle ke function ko behtar karne, soojan kam karne aur posture ya harkat theek karne ka daawa kiya jata hai. Elastic tape par research aam taur par **sham tape se zyada koi chhota ya koi faida nahi** paati (tape jo bina sahi tension ya rukh ke lagayi jaye). Sab se qabil-e-yaqeen asar **hissi** hai: jild par chhoona, mukhtalif harkat ki yaad dahani, aaram aur itminan.
analogy: Think of **a wristband you wear for good luck at an exam**. It does not make you smarter, but it may calm you, and calm helps you do your best. Tape can work a little like that: not by changing tissue, but by changing how you feel and move. That is a real effect, just not the one on the packet. || **Imtihan mein achhe naseeb ke liye pehni hui kalai ki patti** sochein. Yeh aap ko zyada zehin nahi banati, lekin sukoon de sakti hai, aur sukoon aap ko behtareen karne mein madad deta hai. Tape bhi thori aisi kaam kar sakti hai: tissue badal kar nahi, balke aap kaise mehsoos karte aur hilte hain us ko badal kar. Yeh haqeeqi asar hai, bas woh nahi jo packet par likha hai.
compare: Rigid tape and elastic tape compared || Rigid tape aur elastic tape ka muqabla
head: Feature || Pehlu ;; Rigid (athletic) tape || Rigid (athletic) tape ;; Elastic (kinesiology) tape || Elastic (kinesiology) tape
row: Main purpose || Asal maqsad ;; Limit movement and support a joint || Harkat mehdood karna aur joint ko sahara dena ;; Claimed: reduce pain, improve muscle function, reduce swelling || Daawa: dard kam, muscle ka function behtar, soojan kam
row: Evidence || Saboot ;; Some support for ankle support and re-sprain prevention, similar to a brace || Takhne ko sahara dene aur dobara moch rokne ke liye kuch himayat, brace jaisi ;; Mostly small or no benefit over sham; may help comfort a little || Zyada tar sham par chhota ya koi faida nahi; aaram mein thori madad kar sakti hai
row: Proposed mechanism || Mumkina tareeqa-e-kaar ;; Mechanical restriction plus a sensory reminder || Mashini rukawat aur hissi yaad dahani ;; Lifting the skin to improve circulation, "decompress" tissue, change muscle activity || Jild uthana taake gardish behtar ho, tissue "dabao se azaad", muscle ki activity badalna
row: How well mechanisms hold up || Tareeqa-e-kaar kitne qaim rehte hain ;; Mechanical effect is plausible, and effects tend to fade after a short time || Mashini asar qabil-e-yaqeen hai, aur asar thori der baad kam hote hain ;; Skin lifting and tissue decompression have little support; sensory and expectation effects are likely || Jild uthane aur tissue ke dabao ko kam himayat; hissi aur umeed ke asraat mumkin hain
row: Cost and risk || Kharch aur khatra ;; Low cost; skin irritation is possible || Kam kharch; jild ki jalan mumkin ;; Low to moderate cost; allergy and skin irritation are the main risks || Kam se darmiyana kharch; allergy aur jild ki jalan asal khatre
check: An athlete asks, "Does kinesiology tape lift my skin to let blood flow and speed healing?" What is the most honest answer? || Athlete poochhta hai, "Kya kinesiology tape meri jild ko utha kar khoon ka bahao aur sehatyabi tez karti hai?" Sab se imaandar jawab kya hai?
ok: "There is little evidence for that. Studies mostly find small or no benefit compared with fake tape, though it may feel supportive and some people like it." || "Is ka kam saboot hai. Studies zyada tar nakli tape ke muqabale mein chhota ya koi faida nahi paati, halaanke yeh sahara dene wali lag sakti hai aur kuch logon ko pasand hai." || Yes — honest about mechanisms and open about comfort. || Haan — tareeqa-e-kaar ke baare mein imaandar aur aaram ke baare mein khula.
no: "Yes, the tape increases circulation and healing speed." || "Haan, tape gardish aur sehatyabi ki raftar barhati hai." || That claim is not supported. || Yeh daawa himayat shuda nahi.
no: "It is a scam, and you should never use it." || "Yeh dhoka hai, kabhi istemal na karein." || It is usually safe, and some people find it helpful. || Yeh aam taur par mehfooz hai aur kuch logon ko mufeed lagti hai.
check: A footballer sprains his ankle badly and wants to play next week. Which is more reasonable for support? || Footballer ke takhne mein shadeed moch aati hai aur woh agle haftay khelna chahta hai. Sahare ke liye kaun sa zyada munasib hai?
ok: Rigid tape or a brace for support during return to sport, within a rehab plan including exercise and balance work || Khel mein wapsi ke dauran sahare ke liye rigid tape ya brace, exercise aur balance ke kaam wale rehab plan ke andar || Yes — rigid support has some evidence for preventing re-sprain. || Haan — rigid sahare ke liye dobara moch rokne ka kuch saboot hai.
no: Elastic tape alone to replace rehab || Rehab ki jagah akeli elastic tape || Tape does not replace rehab. || Tape rehab ki jagah nahi leti.
no: No support and no rehab || Na sahara na rehab || That raises re-injury risk. || Isse dobara chot ka khatra barhta hai.
check: How would you design a fair trial of elastic tape? || Aap elastic tape ke munsifana trial ka design kaise banayenge?
ok: Compare real tape with sham tape applied without tension or direction, with masked assessors, and measure outcomes that matter to patients || Asal tape ka sham tape se muqabla karein jo bina tension ya rukh ke lagayi gayi ho, masked assessors ke saath, aur woh nateeje naapein jo mareezon ke liye ahem hon || Yes — sham controls and masking separate tape effects from expectation. || Haan — sham controls aur masking tape ke asraat ko umeed se alag karte hain.
no: Compare tape with no tape and ask patients how they feel || Tape ka bina tape se muqabla karein aur mareezon se poochhein kaisa lagta hai || That cannot separate tape from expectation. || Yeh tape ko umeed se alag nahi kar sakta.
no: Test only the athletes who love tape || Sirf un athletes ko aazmayein jo tape pasand karte hain || That biases the results. || Isse nateeje biased hote hain.
mistake: **Believing the mechanism on the packet, or banning something harmless.** "Lifting the skin" and "decompressing the tissue" are not supported, and over-promising damages trust. But tape is usually safe, cheap and sometimes comforting. Offer it as an optional extra if the person likes it, never as the main treatment, and do not let it delay assessment, strengthening or return-to-sport planning. || **Packet par likhe tareeqa-e-kaar par yaqeen karna, ya bezarar cheez par pabandi lagana.** "Jild uthana" aur "tissue ko dabao se azaad karna" himayat shuda nahi, aur zyada waade bharosa nuqsan dete hain. Lekin tape aam taur par mehfooz, sasti aur kabhi kabhi sukoon dene wali hai. Agar insaan ko pasand ho to ise ikhtiyari izafe ke taur par dein, asal ilaaj ke taur par kabhi nahi, aur isay assessment, taqat ke kaam ya khel mein wapsi ke plan mein der na karne dein.
clinic: **Check skin and sensitivity before and during use.** Ask about allergies to adhesives, look at the skin, patch-test if unsure, remove tape gently at any itching, burning, blistering or colour change, and do not apply over broken or fragile skin. Teach patients how to take it off (slowly, along the hair, with oil or water if needed) and not to leave it on longer than advised. If tape helps someone move with more confidence, use that moment to progress exercise. || **Istemal se pehle aur dauran jild aur hassasiyat dekhein.** Chipakne wali cheezon ki allergy ke baare mein poochhein, jild dekhein, shak ho to patch test karein, khujli, jalan, chhale ya rang badalne par tape narmi se utarein, aur toote ya nazuk jild par na lagayein. Mareezon ko utarna sikhayein (aahista, baalon ke saath saath, zaroorat par tel ya paani se) aur batayi gayi muddat se zyada na lagayein. Agar tape kisi ko zyada itminan se hilne mein madad kare to us moqay par exercise ko aage barhayein.
reveal: If tape often does not beat sham, why do athletes swear by it? || Agar tape aksar sham ko nahi haraati to athletes is par qasam kyun khate hain? || Athletes feel better, and it is hard to know whether the tape, the practice or the expectation did it. Context effects can be strong, especially for pain and confidence, and a visible ritual such as taping helps. Athletes also tend to tape when they are at their worst, so regression to the mean and natural recovery make the tape look good. A fair trial separates these, and usually finds the tape's own effect to be small. || Athletes behtar mehsoos karte hain, aur yeh jaanna mushkil hai ke tape, mashq ya umeed ne kiya. Context ke asraat mazboot ho sakte hain, khaaskar dard aur itminan ke liye, aur tape lagane jaisi nazar aane wali rasam madad karti hai. Athletes aksar tab tape lagate hain jab woh sab se kharab halat mein hote hain, isliye regression to the mean aur qudrati sehatyabi tape ko achha dikhate hain. Munsifana trial in ko alag karta hai, aur aam taur par tape ka apna asar chhota paata hai.
case: A 45-year-old runner has anterior knee pain and has bought kinesiology tape after a video promised "instant correction." He asks whether to keep using it while he runs. || The tape is harmless for him, and may help confidence, but it is unlikely to treat the cause. || The therapist says he can keep the tape if he likes it, then assesses his load, strength and technique and gives a strength and running-load plan. || His knee pain improves over eight weeks; he stops taping because he no longer needs it and says the exercises made the difference.
safety: **Taping is not a way to run on a serious injury.** If there is a suspected fracture, ligament rupture, tendon rupture, a hot swollen calf, numbness or severe unrelenting pain, refer first. Never tape tightly over a swollen limb or around a joint so that circulation is reduced. Avoid use on broken skin, in people with fragile skin or poor circulation, and stop at any signs of allergy. || **Taping seriyas chot par daudne ka tareeqa nahi.** Agar fracture, ligament tootne, tendon tootne, garam soojhi hui pindli, sunn hona ya shadeed na rukne wala dard ka shak ho to pehle refer karein. Soojhe hue ang par ya joint ke gird kabhi sakhti se tape na karein ke gardish kam ho. Toote jild par, nazuk jild ya kam gardish wale logon mein istemal se bachein, aur allergy ki nishaniyon par ruk jayein.
evidence: A systematic review of Kinesio Taping in clinical practice concluded that current evidence did not support its use, finding that the tape had at best trivial effects on pain and disability, and that the quality of the trials was variable. A systematic review with meta-analysis of kinesio taping for pain lasting more than four weeks found that the pain reduction compared with sham or other treatments was small and below the threshold that patients consider important, and that the method of application did not explain differences between trials. || Clinical practice mein Kinesio Taping ke ek systematic review ne nateeja nikala ke maujooda saboot is ke istemal ki himayat nahi karta, aur paya ke tape ka dard aur disability par zyada se zyada mamooli asar tha, aur trials ki quality mukhtalif thi. Chaar haftay se zyada rehne wale dard ke liye kinesio taping ke ek systematic review ne meta-analysis ke saath paya ke sham ya doosre ilajon ke muqabale mein dard mein kami chhoti thi aur us had se neeche thi jo mareez ahem samajhte hain, aur ke lagane ka tareeqa trials ke farq ki wazahat nahi karta tha.
memory: **Rigid supports, Elastic soothes.** Rigid tape supports and limits movement; elastic tape mostly soothes and reassures. || **Rigid sahara deti, Elastic sukoon.** Rigid tape sahara deti aur harkat rokti hai; elastic tape zyada tar sukoon aur itminan deti hai.
summary: Rigid tape supports and limits movement; elastic tape has small or no benefit beyond sham for pain and function. || Rigid tape sahara deti aur harkat mehdood karti hai; elastic tape ka dard aur function mein sham se chhota ya koi faida nahi.
summary: Claims about lifting skin or decompressing tissue are not supported; sensory and expectation effects are more likely. || Jild uthane ya tissue ko dabao se azaad karne ke daawe himayat shuda nahi; hissi aur umeed ke asraat zyada mumkin hain.
summary: Use tape as an optional extra, check the skin, and never let it replace assessment, strength work or referral. || Tape ko ikhtiyari izafe ke taur par istemal karein, jild dekhein, aur isay assessment, taqat ke kaam ya refer ki jagah kabhi na dein.
card: What is rigid tape used for? || Rigid tape kis liye istemal hoti hai? || Supporting a joint and limiting movement. || Joint ko sahara dena aur harkat mehdood karna.
card: What do trials mostly find for elastic tape compared with sham? || Elastic tape ke liye trials zyada tar sham ke muqabale mein kya paate hain? || Small or no benefit. || Chhota ya koi faida nahi.
card: Name a likely real effect of tape. || Tape ka ek mumkina haqeeqi asar batayein. || Sensory input, comfort and confidence. || Hissi input, aaram aur itminan.
card: What should you check before taping? || Tape se pehle kya dekhein? || Allergy to adhesive, skin condition and red flags. || Chipkane wali cheez ki allergy, jild ki halat aur red flags.
deeper: Why treatments seem to work || /learn/why-treatments-seem-to-work || Why tape can look effective. || Tape mu'assir kyun lag sakti hai.
deeper: What the evidence really says || /learn/what-the-evidence-says-myth-busting || Other common claims, checked. || Doosre aam daawe, jaanche hue.
source: Parreira PCS, Costa LCM, Hespanhol LC Jr, Lopes AD, Costa LOP. Current evidence does not support the use of Kinesio Taping in clinical practice: a systematic review. J Physiother 2014;60:31-39. || Current evidence does not support the use of Kinesio Taping in clinical practice systematic review Parreira
source: Lim ECW, Tay MGX. Kinesio taping in musculoskeletal pain and disability that lasts for more than 4 weeks: is it time to peel off the tape and throw it out with the sweat? A systematic review with meta-analysis. Br J Sports Med 2015;49:1558-1566. || Kinesio taping in musculoskeletal pain and disability that lasts for more than 4 weeks systematic review with meta-analysis Lim Tay
